# HOOPLA: the CPU can get round the pit as every one of the eight: each
# one, alone against a player who doesn't move, holds five hoops in time.
# (A CPU MOSS muddles his gravity, as the original's CPU does.) Then CPU
# against CPU: every match ends with a winner.
seed 27
game hoopla
wait 30
cheat match 0 0 0
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 1 5
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 2 10
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 3 3
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 4 8
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 5 1
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 6 6
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 7 11
cheat go
waituntil winner == 1 6000
cheat match 0 7 9
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
cheat match 1 6 7
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
cheat match 2 5 5
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
cheat match 3 4 3
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
cheat match 4 2 10
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
cheat match 5 1 8
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
cheat match 6 0 6
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
cheat match 7 3 4
cheat cpuboth
waituntil winner >= 0 7200
